    "input_texts": [
      "Title: ServiceNow Asset List Sorting and Task Closure\nDescription: Steps to sort the Asset list by 'Asset function' and close the associated task.\n- Navigate to the 'All Assets' list via the 'All Assets' link in the navigation menu.\n- Click the 'Show / hide filter' button to reveal the filter options.\n- Click the 'Add Sort' button to configure sorting criteria.\n- Select 'Acquisition method' from the 'Order results by the following fields' combobox.\n- Choose 'Asset function' from the options in the 'Choose option' combobox.\n- Press 'Enter' to confirm the 'Asset function' selection in the combobox.\n- Click the 'Run filter' button to apply the sort order.\n- Update the task state to 'Closed Complete' and click 'Update' to finalize."
